<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Formal Resignation Letter</title>

    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4;
            margin: 0;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: #e9ecef;
            font-family: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", serif;
            color: #252525;
        }

        .page {
            width: 210mm;
            min-height: 297mm;
            margin: 25px auto;
            padding: 22mm 22mm 18mm;
            background: #ffffff;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Decorative top accent */
        .top-accent {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 7px;
            background: linear-gradient(
                90deg,
                #17324d 0%,
                #17324d 70%,
                #c7a44a 70%,
                #c7a44a 100%
            );
        }

        /* Header */
        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding-bottom: 22px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #d9d9d9;
        }

        .logo {
            width: 58px;
            height: 58px;
            border: 2px solid #c7a44a;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #17324d;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .company-info {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .company-name {
            color: #17324d;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .company-details {
            margin-top: 5px;
            color: #777;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 10px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Title */
        .title-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 42px 0 38px;
        }

        .title-section h1 {
            margin: 0;
            color: #17324d;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 25px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .gold-line {
            width: 65px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #c7a44a;
            margin: 14px auto 0;
        }

        /* Date */
        .date {
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        /* Recipient */
        .recipient {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.65;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .recipient-name {
            color: #17324d;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Subject */
        .subject {
            background: #f7f8f9;
            border-left: 4px solid #c7a44a;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            margin: 25px 0 30px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .subject strong {
            color: #17324d;
        }

        /* Letter content */
        .content {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.85;
        }

        .content p {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .salutation {
            margin-bottom: 20px !important;
        }

        /* Closing */
        .closing {
            margin-top: 28px;
        }

        /* Signature */
        .signature {
            margin-top: 38px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .signature-space {
            height: 55px;
        }

        .signature-line {
            width: 235px;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
            padding-top: 8px;
        }

        .signature-name {
            color: #17324d;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .signature-position {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 12mm;
            left: 22mm;
            right: 22mm;
            border-top: 1px solid #dedede;
            padding-top: 9px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            color: #999;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 9px;
        }

        .footer-right {
            color: #17324d;
        }

        /* Print */
        @media print {
            body {
                background: #ffffff;
            }

            .page {
                margin: 0;
                box-shadow: none;
            }
        }

        /* Mobile */
        @media screen and (max-width: 800px) {
            .page {
                width: 100%;
                min-height: 100vh;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 35px 25px 90px;
            }

            .header {
                align-items: flex-start;
            }

            .company-name {
                font-size: 13px;
            }

            .company-details {
                font-size: 9px;
            }

            .title-section h1 {
                font-size: 21px;
            }

            .content {
                font-size: 13px;
            }

            .footer {
                left: 25px;
                right: 25px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="page">

    <div class="top-accent"></div>

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <header class="header">

        <!-- Replace this with your company logo -->
        <div class="logo">
            LOGO
        </div>

        <div class="company-info">
            <div class="company-name">
                [COMPANY NAME]
            </div>

            <div class="company-details">
                [Company Address]<br>
                [City, Province, ZIP Code]<br>
                [Contact Number] • [Email Address]
            </div>
        </div>

    </header>


    <!-- TITLE -->
    <section class="title-section">

        <h1>Resignation Letter</h1>

        <div class="gold-line"></div>

    </section>


    <!-- DATE -->
    <div class="date">
        [Month Day, Year]
    </div>


    <!-- RECIPIENT -->
    <div class="recipient">

        <span class="recipient-name">
            [Manager's Full Name]
        </span><br>

        [Manager's Position]<br>

        [Department]<br>

        [Company Name]

    </div>


    <!-- SUBJECT -->
    <div class="subject">

        <strong>Subject:</strong>
        Formal Resignation from the Position of [Your Position]

    </div>


    <!-- LETTER -->
    <div class="content">

        <p class="salutation">
            Dear [Mr./Ms. Last Name],
        </p>

        <p>
            Please accept this letter as my formal resignation from my position as
            <strong>[Your Position]</strong> at <strong>[Company Name]</strong>.
            My intended last working day will be <strong>[Last Working Day]</strong>,
            in accordance with the applicable notice period and company policy.
        </p>

        <p>
            I would like to express my sincere gratitude for the opportunity to be
            part of the organization. During my time with the company, I have gained
            valuable knowledge, professional experience, and skills that have
            contributed significantly to my personal and career development.
        </p>

        <p>
            I am also deeply appreciative of the guidance, support, and trust extended
            to me by the management and my colleagues. The experiences and professional
            relationships I have developed during my tenure will remain meaningful to me
            as I move forward in my career.
        </p>

        <p>
            This decision has been carefully considered, and I believe it is the right
            step toward my professional and personal growth. I remain committed to
            maintaining professionalism throughout my remaining period and will do my
            best to ensure a smooth and orderly transition. I am willing to assist with
            the proper turnover of my responsibilities, pending tasks, and other
            necessary matters.
        </p>

        <p>
            Thank you for the opportunities, support, and experiences that I have
            received during my employment. I sincerely wish <strong>[Company Name]</strong>,
            the management, and the entire team continued success and prosperity
            in the years ahead.
        </p>

        <p class="closing">
            Thank you for your understanding and consideration.
        </p>

    </div>


    <!-- SIGNATURE -->
    <div class="signature">

        Sincerely,

        <div class="signature-space"></div>

        <div class="signature-line">

            <div class="signature-name">
                [YOUR FULL NAME]
            </div>

            <div class="signature-position">
                [Your Position]<br>
                Employee ID: [Employee ID]
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="footer">

        <div>
            Confidential Employment Correspondence
        </div>

        <div class="footer-right">
            [COMPANY NAME]
        </div>

    </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>

